{"id":"marido","lemma":"marido","pos":"noun","rank":386,"glosses":["husband"],"ipa":"/maˈɾido/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"maridos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/eb/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Sinaloa-marido.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tomás es mi marido.","en":"Tom is my husband.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/519070"},{"text":"Normalmente las mujeres sobreviven a sus maridos.","en":"Women generally outlive their husbands.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/689556"},{"text":"Será un buen marido.","en":"He'll be a good husband.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/933893"},{"text":"Muchas mujeres se quejan de sus maridos.","en":"Many wives complain about their husbands."},{"text":"Quiero ser tu marido.","en":"I want to be your husband.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590427"}]}